  "dek": "A late climb to 66.53 lifts the provisional gold line from 64.72 to 66.53 over the day and leaves four entries within a point of the cutoff, while Tufa Labs and Yi-Chia Chen stay clear.",
  "discord": "ARC-AGI-2 Late edition: matu997 takes the last ARC-2 gold place and pushes NguyenThanhNhan out. matu997 rose from 20th to 16th at 66.53, which is now the provisional gold cutoff, up from 64.72. NguyenThanhNhan (65.97) is 17th, and ibyyue, artificialagencylab.com and shiiin9 share 65.56 just behind. Tufa Labs (88.06), Yi-Chia Chen (84.72) and rabbithole (80.83) lead unchanged. https://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-21-evening-arc-2",
