  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "The line moves again",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-21-0957-arc-2-nguyenthanhnan-into-gold"
      ],
      "text": "matu997 advanced from 64.31 to 66.53 in a late-day score event, climbing from 20th to 16th and into the last of the 16 provisional gold places. That score is now the gold cutoff, up from 64.72 against the edition baseline. It displaces NguyenThanhNhan, whom the wire put into gold at 16th that morning on a 13.89-point jump to 65.97. NguyenThanhNhan now sits 17th, 0.56 short. These public medal bands remain provisional."
    },
    {
      "heading": "A crowd just outside",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-21-0602-arc-2-ibyyue-slips-out-of-gold"
      ],
      "text": "Three entries share 65.56 directly behind NguyenThanhNhan: ibyyue, artificialagencylab.com and Osaka Metropolitan University's shiiin9, which gained 12.64 over the edition baseline and climbed eight places to 20th. ibyyue was reported slipping out of gold earlier in the day and now stands 0.97 below the cutoff. The ARC-2 artificialagencylab.com entry is a separate record from the team of the same name on the ARC-3 board. With four entries inside a point of the line, one more advance could change the medal map again."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Tufa and Chen stay clear",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs holds first at 88.06, with Yi-Chia Chen second at 84.72 and rabbithole third at 80.83, all unchanged. Below them nvbanana is fourth at 79.72 and Majkel1337 fifth at 75.56. Youssef Nader remains 11th at 70.56 and mikelou1 12th at 69.72, up 3.33 since the baseline. ARC Raiders is 13th at 68.33."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Climbers lower down",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-21-0805-arc-2-kusui26-enters-top-hundred",
        "wire-2026-10-21-1205-arc-2-tatu-helander-climbs-to-sixty-sixth",
        "wire-2026-10-21-1402-arc-2-katlun-climbs-into-top-seventy"
      ],
      "text": "kibuna added 14.16 to reach 54.72 and rose 24 places to 31st, the biggest score gain among the featured movers. Aneesh & Yash gained 7.36 to 53.33 in 33rd. kusui26, which the wire placed 90th at 34.44, now stands 58th at 40.28. The wire also followed Tatu Helander to 66th at 37.64 and katlun from 1,257th to 69th at 37.50; those are dated wire observations, and on the latest board the pair sit 67th and 69th. ARC Mutants holds 61st at 39.31, unchanged and two places lower than the baseline. The social scan was not refreshed for this edition."
    }
